// ==========================================================================
// Gmail Workflow Automation — single-file build
//
// Generated by tools/bundle.js. Do not edit this file; edit src/ and rebuild
// with `npm run bundle`. Paste the whole thing into one Apps Script file.
//
// You still need src/appsscript.json in the project manifest — it declares
